1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:16,380
luke three in the fifteenth year of the reign of tiberius caesar pontius pilate being governor of judea and herod being tetrarch of galilee and his brother philip tetrarch of the region of iturea and trachonitis

2
00:00:16,380 --> 00:00:34,080
and lysanias tetrarch of abilene during the high priesthood of annas and caiaphas the word of god came to john the son of zachariah in the wilderness and he went into all the region around the jordan proclaiming a baptism of repentance for the forgiveness of sins

3
00:00:34,080 --> 00:00:44,660
as it is written in the book of the words of isaiah the prophet the voice of one crying in the wilderness prepare the way of the lord make his path straight

4
00:00:44,660 --> 00:00:46,360
every valley shall be filled

5
00:00:46,360 --> 00:00:49,120
and every mountain and hill shall be made low

6
00:00:49,120 --> 00:00:51,160
and the crooked shall become straight

7
00:00:51,160 --> 00:00:54,100
and the rough places shall become level ways

8
00:00:54,100 --> 00:00:57,420
and all flesh shall see the salvation of God.

9
00:00:58,240 --> 00:01:00,400
He said therefore to the crowds that came out

10
00:01:00,400 --> 00:01:01,980
to be baptized by him,

11
00:01:02,320 --> 00:01:04,220
You brood of vipers,

12
00:01:04,660 --> 00:01:07,020
who warned you to flee from the wrath to come?

13
00:01:07,920 --> 00:01:09,780
Bear fruits in keeping with repentance

14
00:01:09,780 --> 00:01:12,140
and do not begin to say to yourselves,

15
00:01:12,380 --> 00:01:14,840
We have Abraham as our father.

16
00:01:14,840 --> 00:01:18,060
For I tell you, God is able from these stones

17
00:01:18,060 --> 00:01:19,900
to raise up children for Abraham.

18
00:01:20,760 --> 00:01:23,640
Even now the axe is laid to the root of the trees.

19
00:01:24,120 --> 00:01:26,680
Every tree therefore that does not bear good fruit

20
00:01:26,680 --> 00:01:29,400
is cut down and thrown into the fire.

21
00:01:30,540 --> 00:01:32,120
And the crowds asked him,

22
00:01:32,820 --> 00:01:34,040
What then shall we do?

23
00:01:34,620 --> 00:01:36,320
And he answered them,

24
00:01:37,060 --> 00:01:40,480
Whoever has two tunics is to share with him who has none,

25
00:01:41,080 --> 00:01:43,640
and whoever has food is to do likewise.

26
00:01:43,640 --> 00:01:47,920
Tax collectors also came to be baptized and said to him,

27
00:01:48,700 --> 00:01:50,800
Teacher, what shall we do?

28
00:01:51,520 --> 00:01:52,660
And he said to them,

29
00:01:53,420 --> 00:01:55,840
Collect no more than you are authorized to do.

30
00:01:56,700 --> 00:01:58,520
Soldiers also asked him,

31
00:01:59,260 --> 00:02:01,580
And we, what shall we do?

32
00:02:02,300 --> 00:02:03,380
And he said to them,

33
00:02:04,280 --> 00:02:08,460
Do not extort money from anyone by threats or by false accusation

34
00:02:08,460 --> 00:02:10,680
and be content with your wages.

35
00:02:11,320 --> 00:02:13,260
As the people were in expectation,

36
00:02:13,640 --> 00:02:16,740
and all were questioning in their hearts concerning John

37
00:02:16,740 --> 00:02:18,880
whether he might be the Christ.

38
00:02:19,600 --> 00:02:21,580
John answered them all, saying,

39
00:02:22,080 --> 00:02:24,460
I baptize you with water,

40
00:02:24,840 --> 00:02:27,260
but he who is mightier than I is coming,

41
00:02:27,260 --> 00:02:30,920
the strap of whose sandals I am not worthy to untie.

42
00:02:31,520 --> 00:02:34,960
He will baptize you with the Holy Spirit and with fire.

43
00:02:35,580 --> 00:02:37,640
His winnowing fork is in his hand

44
00:02:37,640 --> 00:02:42,120
to clear his threshing floor and to gather the wheat into his barn.

45
00:02:42,640 --> 00:02:43,560
But the chaff,

46
00:02:43,640 --> 00:02:45,800
he will burn with unquenchable fire.

47
00:02:47,040 --> 00:02:50,900
So with many other exhortations he preached good news to the people.

48
00:02:51,560 --> 00:02:52,960
But Herod the Tetrarch,

49
00:02:53,240 --> 00:02:57,040
who had been reproved by him for Herodias, his brother's wife,

50
00:02:57,380 --> 00:03:00,200
and for all the evil things that Herod had done,

51
00:03:00,880 --> 00:03:03,900
added this to them all that he locked up John in prison.

52
00:03:05,600 --> 00:03:07,680
Now when all the people were baptized,

53
00:03:07,680 --> 00:03:11,380
and when Jesus also had been baptized and was praying,

54
00:03:11,900 --> 00:03:12,920
the heavens were opened,

55
00:03:12,920 --> 00:03:18,260
and the Holy Spirit descended on him in bodily form like a dove,

56
00:03:18,660 --> 00:03:20,400
and a voice came from heaven.

57
00:03:20,800 --> 00:03:23,060
You are my beloved Son.

58
00:03:23,900 --> 00:03:26,820
With you I am well pleased.

59
00:03:28,440 --> 00:03:32,720
Jesus, when he began his ministry, was about thirty years of age,

60
00:03:33,320 --> 00:03:35,740
being the son, as was supposed, of Joseph,

61
00:03:36,200 --> 00:03:38,500
the son of Heli, the son of Mathet,

62
00:03:38,880 --> 00:03:41,360
the son of Levi, the son of Melchi,

63
00:03:41,360 --> 00:03:42,900
the son of Jenea,

64
00:03:43,320 --> 00:03:44,600
the son of Joseph,

65
00:03:44,840 --> 00:03:46,280
the son of Mattathias,

66
00:03:46,600 --> 00:03:47,800
the son of Amos,

67
00:03:47,960 --> 00:03:49,000
the son of Naam,

68
00:03:49,320 --> 00:03:50,740
the son of Es Hashem,

69
00:03:50,820 --> 00:03:51,320
the son of Es aubad,

70
00:03:51,320 --> 00:03:51,840
the son of Ez- số Kimwa,

71
00:03:51,880 --> 00:03:52,380
the son ofày Major- Damascene,

72
00:03:52,720 --> 00:03:53,420
the son of Negei,

73
00:03:53,480 --> 00:03:53,980
the son of Egy,

74
00:03:53,980 --> 00:03:54,660
the son of Meíz,

75
00:03:54,680 --> 00:03:55,180
the son of afflictedchano,

76
00:03:55,180 --> 00:03:55,840
the son of Mattathias,

77
00:03:56,140 --> 00:03:57,220
the son of Simeon,

78
00:03:57,520 --> 00:03:58,680
the son of Josech,

79
00:03:59,060 --> 00:03:59,560
the son of Joan- visah,

80
00:03:59,560 --> 00:04:00,300
the son of Jourdhah,

81
00:04:00,500 --> 00:04:01,700
the son of Joannan,

82
00:04:01,800 --> 00:04:02,600
the son of Reza,

83
00:04:02,600 --> 00:04:03,940
the son of Heilig-e-Shaktan,

84
00:04:03,940 --> 00:04:05,060
the son of Zerubbabel,

85
00:04:05,060 --> 00:04:06,520
the son of Shealtiel,

86
00:04:07,000 --> 00:04:08,160
the son of Neri,

87
00:04:08,160 --> 00:04:09,360
the son of Melchi,

88
00:04:12,920 --> 00:04:20,480
the son of Elmadim, the son of Ur, the son of Joshua, the son of Eleazar, the son of Joram,

89
00:04:20,640 --> 00:04:28,000
the son of Mathat, the son of Levi, the son of Simeon, the son of Judah, the son of Joseph,

90
00:04:28,500 --> 00:04:35,780
the son of Jonam, the son of Eliakim, the son of Meliah, the son of Mena, the son of Mattathah,

91
00:04:35,780 --> 00:04:42,940
the son of Nathan, the son of David, the son of Jesse, the son of Obed, the son of Boaz,

92
00:04:43,140 --> 00:04:49,700
the son of Selah, the son of Nashan, the son of Amenadab, the son of Admin, the son of Arni,

93
00:04:50,180 --> 00:04:56,780
the son of Hezron, the son of Perez, the son of Judah, the son of Jacob, the son of Isaac,

94
00:04:57,220 --> 00:05:03,660
the son of Abraham, the son of Terah, the son of Nahor, the son of Sirag, the son of Rehu,

95
